WEBVTT

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:05.690
Hey, is it really okay to be this close?

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:07.980
Watch it from afar!

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:45.570
Cold-water cleansing complete!

00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:50.020
Okay, before our date, I'm going to ask the gods and test my odds!

00:02:21.830 --> 00:02:26.200
Risking it All! Uffun, First Date!

00:02:31.010 --> 00:02:34.960
Oh please, please,
<i>please</i>  let it be a good capsule!

00:02:36.310 --> 00:02:38.250
And now, the moment of truth.

00:02:41.490 --> 00:02:45.510
If this capsule makes me look refreshingly pretty,
then the date will be a success!

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:49.470
If I turn into something weird, then the date will go so badly that my husband might dump me.

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:58.190
Not that it really matters,
but my date with her <i>is</i>  tomorrow...

00:02:58.190 --> 00:03:00.650
I guess it wouldn't hurt
to have my fortune told.

00:03:00.650 --> 00:03:02.990
You know, just in case-

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:10.260
Is that...? Wow, what a coincidence!

00:03:10.260 --> 00:03:13.910
Maybe we really are bound together by the red string of fate!

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:17.880
Hafun, hafuun! Any way you slice it,
I certainly look pretty refreshing.

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:19.130
"Hafun, hafuun"?

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:23.950
Excellent!  This must mean that
my date with Darling will be a success!

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:26.140
What?!

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:31.270
Yay! A date, a date with my husband!!

00:03:32.570 --> 00:03:35.350
That sneaky little Rizel deceived me!!

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:38.270
Shiiiiit!!!

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:43.150
All done!

00:03:43.150 --> 00:03:46.590
It's a date, after all -
I should have a present for him!

00:03:46.590 --> 00:03:48.540
Will it look good on him?

00:03:49.490 --> 00:03:52.500
Well, India is a good place to practice pro wrestling, after all.

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:53.650
Oh, like the "Warrior of Love"?

00:03:53.650 --> 00:03:54.120
Papas! Is the thing I asked for ready?
Oh, like the "Warrior of Love"?

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:56.020
Papas! Is the thing I asked for ready?

00:03:56.020 --> 00:03:56.490
Yes, it is!
Papas! Is the thing I asked for ready?

00:03:56.490 --> 00:03:57.350
Yes, it is!

00:03:57.350 --> 00:04:00.130
The special pouch for tomorrow's date, right?

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:02.840
Yeah! So you made it
according to my designs?

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:04.760
But of course! Behold!

00:04:08.610 --> 00:04:12.440
It's like the design, only... bigger. Why, why?!

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:13.940
Allow me to explain.

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:16.400
You'll want your date to last
for at least five hours.

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:19.440
In order to remain in your adult form for the entire time,

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:22.230
you'll need to use 100 capsules.

00:04:22.230 --> 00:04:24.150
Ehh?? That many?!

00:04:24.150 --> 00:04:28.460
Unless it's this large,
it won't be able to hold that many.

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:30.780
However, it is remotely controllable.

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:33.110
See? Pretty well-made, isn't it?

00:04:33.110 --> 00:04:35.670
Wow, it's great! Thank you!

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:38.220
Okay, let's get those 100 capsules loaded now!

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:42.140
Huh? Nothing came out...

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:46.510
NOOOO!!!

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:47.970
Huh? What? What is it?

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:51.470
We never made that many capsules to begin with!

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:53.240
And now the pouch is useless, too!

00:04:53.240 --> 00:04:53.840
We're so sorry, Rizel!
And now the pouch is useless, too!

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:55.350
We're so sorry, Rizel!

00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:59.350
It's empty? There aren't any more?!

00:04:59.350 --> 00:05:00.600
None at all!

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:02.570
Then make some more before tomorrow!

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:02.960
It's impossible!
Then make some more before tomorrow!

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:03.940
It's impossible!

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:04.560
No...!
It's impossible!

00:05:04.560 --> 00:05:05.690
No...!

00:05:05.690 --> 00:05:08.280
Darling was really looking forward to it...

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:08.860
Please go out on a date with me!
Darling was really looking forward to it...

00:05:08.860 --> 00:05:10.760
Please go out on a date with me!

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:13.370
I wanted to make him even happier...

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:14.830
We really are sorry...

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:18.040
We simply can't make that many capsules before tomorrow.

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.840
Is there no other way?

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:22.040
Well, there is <i>that</i>...

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:24.990
What's "that"?

00:05:24.990 --> 00:05:26.780
What? What is it??

00:05:32.070 --> 00:05:36.260
Sorry, Papas, but I'd rather
disappoint you than my husband.

00:05:42.990 --> 00:05:47.290
"That" is an artificial cellular growth acceleration drug.

00:05:47.290 --> 00:05:50.150
It's located at the highest-security
facility in Japan.

00:05:50.150 --> 00:05:54.670
The capsules you used were only
a thousandth as strong as that drug.

00:05:54.670 --> 00:05:58.580
We don't know what side effects
there will be if you use it undiluted.

00:05:59.050 --> 00:06:03.150
Rizel, you'll have to bear with it
and give up this time.

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:07.550
No matter what you say,
my first date with Darling won't wait!

00:06:20.940 --> 00:06:22.870
Huh? It opened!

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:28.280
What's that?

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:32.510
Could this be the something-something cell growth drug?

00:06:32.510 --> 00:06:33.700
Ah! It opened!

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:40.130
Oh, which one should I choose?

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:45.670
God in heaven and god of manga, please guide my choice!

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:46.790
This one!

00:06:49.270 --> 00:06:52.420
Hmmm, growing up sure is tough.

00:07:03.700 --> 00:07:06.060
Yes! I've grown up!!

00:07:06.910 --> 00:07:09.360
Well, there's no use crying over spilled milk.

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:12.780
Nonetheless, if you start to feel unwell,
come straight home.

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:13.940
Yes, sir.

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:16.520
The effects will last longer than 3 minutes,
but they'll probably...

00:07:16.520 --> 00:07:19.160
...begin to wear off around midnight.
So make sure to be home by then.

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:20.490
Yes, yes...

00:07:20.490 --> 00:07:22.830
Could you give this to my husband?

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:23.590
Here.

00:07:23.590 --> 00:07:24.550
What's this?

00:07:24.550 --> 00:07:26.210
It's a detailed timetable for our date.

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:30.920
We'll be meeting soon, but it'd be strange for <i>me</i>  to give it to him beforehand.

00:07:30.920 --> 00:07:33.840
I sure hope he'll like this present.

00:07:33.840 --> 00:07:35.720
See you later!

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:38.890
It'd be equally weird
if <i>we</i>  gave it to him.

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:43.660
Ah, that's it! I'll send this in a letter addressed to Tomonori-kun.

00:07:43.660 --> 00:07:45.190
Oh, nice idea!

00:07:45.190 --> 00:07:46.150
Okay, get this, then he...

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:46.960
Aoi-chan!!
Okay, get this, then he...

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:47.800
Aoi-chan!!

00:07:49.960 --> 00:07:52.530
Excuse me, but who are you?

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:54.740
It's me, Rizel!

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:58.010
I'm off to my first date with my Darling!

00:07:58.010 --> 00:07:59.160
See you later!

00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:02.580
Like hell I'll go!

00:08:02.890 --> 00:08:05.450
I know Rizel transformed into her.

00:08:05.450 --> 00:08:06.630
SAY WHAT?!

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:09.990
She showed her true colors when she tricked me like that.

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:12.000
How could I possibly date her?!

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:13.140
Tomonori-kun!

00:08:13.140 --> 00:08:13.920
What?

00:08:13.920 --> 00:08:17.800
I'm sure you know that Rizel didn't mean to deceive you.

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:25.500
Having taken a potentially fatal drug,
she's put her life on the line for you today.

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:29.560
Rizel is only trying as hard as she can,
all to make you happy!

00:08:29.560 --> 00:08:31.190
Please understand.

00:08:31.590 --> 00:08:35.490
What about <i>my</i>  feelings?!
I have feelings too, you know!

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:37.450
Hey, Tomonori-kun!

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:43.530
Hmm, I'm a bit early.

00:08:43.530 --> 00:08:47.580
But I hope that Darling will get here soon,
so we can start our first date!

00:08:55.520 --> 00:08:58.010
She even made up this schedule...

00:08:59.860 --> 00:09:01.550
Goodness, you're late-

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:03.400
Hey, are you alone?

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:05.640
If your boyfriend's not coming,
you should come hang out with us.

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:07.320
Oh no, it's about to start!

00:09:07.320 --> 00:09:10.430
Sorry, but today's my first date
with my husband!

00:09:11.060 --> 00:09:13.230
What is she, some kind of child bride?

00:09:13.230 --> 00:09:15.250
I understand, Darling...

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:18.290
You're so shy that you went on ahead to wait for me at the theater.

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:20.740
That's so cute of you!

00:09:27.390 --> 00:09:32.240
How sly - you're planning to sneak in
and surprise me after the lights go down!

00:09:56.990 --> 00:10:00.530
Excuse me, but would you like to order something while you wait?

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:05.670
No... no, he'll be here...
in just a little while...

00:10:05.670 --> 00:10:08.490
So... so... I'll just wait a little longer...

00:10:08.490 --> 00:10:11.040
I'll come back by here later.

00:10:11.370 --> 00:10:15.460
Did you lose your way, Darling?

00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:23.280
She... she's probably gone home by now...

00:10:24.510 --> 00:10:27.470
"New Urasaki Zoo"

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:34.230
You're kidding! She <i>still</i>  isn't back yet?!

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:36.440
Wasn't she with you?

00:10:37.130 --> 00:10:40.690
Hell if I know! She's just off
playing by herself somewhere.

00:10:48.600 --> 00:10:51.580
I've put so much effort
into the present for him...

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:09.350
Dammit, where is she?!

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:17.980
It's almost midnight...

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:28.530
I went to so much trouble to transform my body, all for my Darling...

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:34.750
Now the magic's about to wear off...

00:11:39.240 --> 00:11:42.970
What are you doing, you idiot?!
Why'd you take it this far?

00:11:47.370 --> 00:11:51.770
Did you... did you really want to go out with me that badly?

00:11:53.800 --> 00:11:55.640
Darling...

00:12:04.380 --> 00:12:05.740
Rizel...

00:12:07.390 --> 00:12:10.430
You really... you really did come!

00:12:10.430 --> 00:12:12.360
Darling!

00:12:12.360 --> 00:12:15.200
Darling, Darling!!

00:12:15.200 --> 00:12:18.830
Darling... Darling...

00:12:18.830 --> 00:12:20.130
Huh...?

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:21.350
Rizel!

00:14:09.770 --> 00:14:13.620
I'm really worried about what's going
to happen to Rizel and Tomonori now...

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:15.360
Hey! What are you doing?!

00:14:15.360 --> 00:14:17.960
I shall now read a haiku,
inspired by this situation:

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:21.150
The dog is in heat;
now the dog clings to my leg
And will not let go.

00:14:21.150 --> 00:14:23.830
Hey, stop licking me!

00:14:26.770 --> 00:14:28.720
Aoi's here! And so is autumn.

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:30.610
I'm worried about
Rizel-chan and Iwaki-kun,

00:14:30.610 --> 00:14:33.670
but I'm even more worried
about my own love life.

00:14:33.670 --> 00:14:35.500
Oh, how cute!

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:36.810
And now for some poetry:

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:38.880
My feelings for him,
I carry within my heart.

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:42.300
If I were a dog,
I could find a way to cope.
I think I am in trouble.

00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:44.380
Ahem! Er, anyway, next time...

00:14:44.380 --> 00:14:48.880
It's a triple feature: "Hafu, hafu, Aoi! 笙･"
"Aoi's Shyness," and "Aoi's Loss."

00:14:48.880 --> 00:14:50.760
Rock-Paper-Scissors!

00:14:50.760 --> 00:14:53.310
Oops, that was the preview for the episode after next!
